     "t": "or FFP / lyophilised plasma 10–20 mL/kg over 1–2 h",
     "s": "stg-paed:19.15"
    },
    {
     "n": "1.4",
     "t": "Still hypotensive: dopamine 5–15 mcg/kg/min",
